<title>USA: W. Des Moines CSD, Iowa., won by Seattle Northwest.</title>
<headline>W. Des Moines CSD, Iowa., won by Seattle Northwest.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Seattle Northwest Securities Corp. said it won $3 million of West Des Moines CSD, Iowa, school bonds, with a net interest cost of 4.7312 percent.</p>
</text>
